A L G O L - Г Д P
    (7.01.82)

     1.     ′COMMENT′ A COMMENT BEFORE THE PROGRAM;
     2.     ′BEGIN′
     3.         ′COMMENT′ A COMMENT IN A BLOCK, WITH ′BEGIN′ AND ′END′ INSIDE;
     4.         ′INTEGER′ I;
